. * ImputedDataBorder key (bordersegment fipsstate year quarter).
. order bordersegment quarter_index st_min st_max b_uA b_uB b_lA b_lB b_pA b_pB
>  b_vacA b_vacB phiA phiB qratio

. sort bordersegment quarter_index

